# Language policy — Ollanta Tours

- The site supports **only English (EN), Spanish (ES), and French (FR)** via the header language switch.
- **Never** put Czech (or any other language) into UI copy, tour names, locations, FAQs, footers, marquee text, alt text, or HTML placeholders.
- When the user sends text in Czech (or another language), **translate it** into EN, ES, and FR and store it in `script.js` i18n (`en` / `es` / `fr`).
- Default visible fallback text in HTML should be **English**.
- English keys live under `i18n.en`, Spanish under `i18n.es`, and French under `i18n.fr`. Keep all three in sync whenever adding or editing copy.
